  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Privata sektorns roll</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private Sector Providers - The role of NGO Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande syftet med projektet &#xe4;r att utveckla metoder f&#xf6;r att b&#xe4;ttre utnyttja privata v&#xe5;rdgivare f&#xf6;r b&#xe4;ttre och effektivare h&#xe4;lsoinsatser i v&#xe5;ra samarbetsl&#xe4;nder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to strenthen health systems performance and their outcome in terms of improved health, and to strenghten the role of the public sector to act as a regulator of private sector providers.</narrative>
  </description>
